[00:10.178]Do you recall, not long ago
{"还记得吗 就在不久前"}
[00:12.708]We would walk on the sidewalk?
{"我们曾并肩漫步人行道"}
[00:15.089]Innocent, remember?
{"天真无邪 还记得吗"}
[00:17.479]All we did was care for each other
{"我们只顾着彼此照料"}
[00:20.117]But the night was warm
{"但那个夜晚如此温暖"}
[00:21.892]We were bold and young
{"我们年少轻狂无所畏惧"}
[00:24.827]All around, the wind blows
{"四周风起云涌"}
[00:27.065]We would only hold on to let go
{"我们紧握双手只为学会放手"}
[00:29.663]
[00:29.840]Blow a kiss, fire a gun
{"飞吻如子弹发射"}
[00:32.016]We need someone to lean on
{"我们需要依靠的肩膀"}
[00:34.607]Blow a kiss, fire a gun
{"飞吻如子弹发射"}
[00:36.860]All we need is somebody to lean on
{"我们需要的不过是个依靠"}
