[01:08.947]What will we do when we get old?
{"当年华老去该如何自处"}
[01:11.191]Will we walk down the same road?
{"是否仍同行这条旧路"}
[01:13.873]Will you be there by my side?
{"你会否依然守候在侧"}
[01:16.207]Standin' strong as the waves roll over
{"如礁石般屹立浪涛中"}
[01:19.061]When the nights are long
{"当长夜漫漫无期"}
[01:20.701]Longing for you to come home
{"盼你归家的思念蔓延"}
